    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In the bustling corridors of Kenyatta National Hospital, Lovin Adhiambo moves with a quiet grace that belies the intensity of her work. As a nurse in the newborn unit, she is a beacon of hope for countless families navigating the delicate balance between life and death. Her journey into nursing, however, was far from predictable.",
